'''Chroma Treat''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] that is obtainable by purchasing the Treat Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or the Sweet Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Event]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same appearance as [[Treat]], but with alternating colors.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Treat]].
* It pairs with the godly knife [[Chroma Sweet]], creating the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Sweet Set|Chroma Sweet Set]].

